{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122030","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1012203001:0":{"text":"イヴォンヌ殿、我々は頼まれてここへ来た。あなたの露玉の助けを必要としている人たちがいるんだ。","source_cn":"伊温小姐，我知道你在。我们受人所托，想请你用露珠救助大家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EA0BA253FB8EBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012203002:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい……今は……手が離せないんです……","source_cn":"对不起……我……无法抽身……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB54F44B0D0BB80CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012203003:0":{"text":"もし雨を止めたら、災害が……あっという間に広がってしまう。止めることはできないけど……遅らせることは、できます……","source_cn":"如果雨停了，灾难……会迅速蔓延。虽然我……无法阻止，但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D2AB840EC1C513B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012203004:0":{"text":"無理しちゃだめですよ、イヴォンヌさん！その声、もう限界じゃないですか……このまま頑張っても、この腐敗は止まりませんよ。","source_cn":"伊温小姐，别硬撑啊！你听上去已经精疲力尽了……以你的力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x566861D42B82100A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012203005:0":{"text":"もし……雨を止めたら、わたしの友だちが……それだけはだめ！友だちを、守らないと……","source_cn":"如果……雨停下来，我的朋友将会……不行！<style=...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB953D12A6990F183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_